	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Mitto ad te bona fide scriptarum literarum exemplum, quo intelliges, quibus <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>modis et veteribus privilegiis principum expoliarint Caesarei meritissima<lb xml:id="p1z3"/>m de maioribus suis urbem, <persName ref="p18538">Carolus</persName> et libertatis specie nova eos <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>et multis saeculis inaudita servitute gravarit, im[m]o et damnarit, paucorum <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>hominum in gratiam, qui aristocratiam sibi offerri sunt passi, quae <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>nescio an holigarchia sit magis.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Certe fenestram magnam aperit <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>proditionibus noscendis et nunc primum manu prehendendis, quae <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>non unam modo urbem ante habito et perpesso bello perdidere et <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>religionis puritatem subverterunt protinus.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Sed de hoc alias.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z10"/><placeName ref="l257">Constantienses</placeName> tandem domini gratia ad sanguinem usque restiterunt, amissis <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>plusculis honestis [s]imis viris, sed pro patria mortuis, ut hoc modo <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>oppeciisse quam superstitem esse multis modis sit optabilius.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Dabit illis <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>gratiam Deus, qua quam multis vel hoc solo facinore exantlato longe eru<lb xml:id="p1z14"/>nt chariores quam ante unquam.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Huius diei meridie <placeName ref="l291">Lindavii</placeName> pran<lb xml:id="p1z15"/>si sunt <persName ref="p8178">Thomas Blaurerus</persName>, <persName>Hieronymus Hirussius</persName> et tribunus <lb xml:id="p1z16"/><persName ref="p5572">Labharterus</persName>, ex <placeName ref="l18">Augustana</placeName> illa catasta tandem dimissi.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Recta <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>erant <placeName ref="l257">Constantiam</placeName> per <placeName ref="l409">Ravenspurgam</placeName> ituri; at ubi obsidionis et simul <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>susceptae cladis mature et praeter opinionem admoniti sunt, in montana <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>sese receperunt et ex <placeName>Isna Lindavium</placeName> venerunt hodie mane.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Non <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>dubito autem, quin, myoparone delati, iam nunc suos <placeName ref="l257">Constantię</placeName> solentur <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>et animent.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Ferunt autem, <persName>Caesarem</persName> brevi Augusta abiturum, sed ignorari, <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>quorsum sit cum plaustris illis suis factionum et artium repturus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Ex Habio intelliges, quo viro nobiscum Antronius egerit; turpissi<lb xml:id="p2z2"/>me caussa cecidit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="de">Wir habend seinem gesandten vor ainem erbaren <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>radt alhie dermaßen den stoub von den oren geblaßen, das <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>er seinem zuͦsagen nach khainen beystand weyter seinen underthonen <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>zuͦ Baden hat laisten wellen, und die selbigen ouch gar nit <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>mer (wie sy veranlasset worden) zuͦ <placeName ref="l21">Baden</placeName> erschinen sind.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p2z7"/>Welte gott, daß er nun mit uns in das recht stuͤnd, wo wurd <lb xml:id="p2z8"/>man schöne zotten hören.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Vere, vere indigna est bestia <lb xml:id="p2z9"/>illa bonorum hominum favore, certo conscia perniciosarum <lb xml:id="p2z10"/>factionum.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Sed alio tempore plura.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Iam isthec ut illinerem <lb xml:id="p2z11"/>magis, quam scriberem, vix vacabat.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l473">Sangalli</placeName>, VIII. die Augu<lb xml:id="p2z12"/>sti, anno MDXLVIII.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p8049">Vadianus</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse:]</note>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Domino <persName ref="p495">Henrycho Bullingero</persName>, suo.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
